  "uid": "agentic-netops-collector-health",
  "title": "Collector health — device telemetry pipeline",
  "description": "T132 (FR-086, FR-089, NFR-002, SC-037): every stage of the device pipeline — scrape targets, gNMIc (device sessions, subscribe errors, OTLP export), the OpenTelemetry Collector (receiver accepted/refused, exporter sent/failed, queue) — and the size of the gap an outage left: points refused or failed and seconds without device samples over the selected range.",
